# No DATABASE_URL here on purpose: leaving it unset (or with a placeholder
# value) in Vercel would cause the Storage → Connect Database integration to
# hit an "already exists" conflict. The app auto-detects whatever Postgres
# connection variable the integration creates (DATABASE_URL, POSTGRES_URL,
# or a custom prefix) — see the README's "Публикация в Vercel" section.

# Пароль вкладки «Руководителю». Без переменной пароль — admin.
# CONTROL_PASSWORD=
